  Yes.  If your pet won't stay by you, you need to stay by your pet.

>Get a whistle, bell or leaf as soon as you can to keep it near.

   Pets will stay close if you're carrying an appropriate treat in open
inventory.  Meatballs and tripe rations for carnivores.  Apples and
pears for herbivores.  They're like velcro.  Healers start with apples
and can manufacture meatballs with the starting spell of stone to flesh.

  Leashes and magic whistles are also a great help.

